; Every command the binary offers, one module each, over the shared half in
; Common; the launcher that forks the daemon's processes and the one-shot runner
; a command goes through are here too, being the CLI's own. Private: it depends
; on the frontend and backend aggregators, whose (select ...) is re-asked on
; each build of the binary.

